summary.label:
Game industry community at your fingertips! WN Hub is a powerful all-in-one platform for the game industry, aiming to establish strong business ties between market players and make the game industry bloom with new projects and cooperation.

The hub is more than just a social platform. It’s a whole ecosystem within one app that allows you to network, form new business ties, visit and host online events, stay updated on the industry news, and level up your professional skills.

STAY UPDATED AND LEVEL UP YOUR GAME 
- Read the latest news of the game industry all across the world;
- Watch video lectures from the game industry conferences; 
- Study the list of publishers and the projects they’re looking for; 
- Keep track of the upcoming events on WN Hub.

ONLINE CONFERENCE JUST AS GOOD AS PHYSICAL EVENT
- Meet game developers, international platforms, and publishers representatives from all over the world;
- Visit and host virtual and hybrid events using fascinating engagement anchors and the latest features of the field;
- Join any event from anywhere in the world even on the go;
- Browse Virtual Expo and study Developer Showcase;
- Schedule meetings with both online and on-site event attendees;
- Chat with every user of the platform.

WN Hub is a powerful all-in-one platform for the game industry, aiming to establish strong business ties between market players and make the game industry bloom with new projects and cooperation.
